# Per-deployment PWA branding.
#
# Everything a user sees WHILE USING the app (business name, logo, slogan,
# theme, currency) is configured live from Settings and stored in the
# database -- it needs no rebuild and no env var.
#
# These three variables are the one exception: the name/icon shown when
# someone installs the app to their phone/desktop home screen. That comes
# from a PWA manifest file, which is generated once at build time and read
# by the OS before the app (and therefore before any API call) ever runs.
# Set these once per pharmacy deployment, then `npm run build`.

VITE_APP_NAME="Pharmacy System"
VITE_APP_SHORT_NAME="Pharmacy"
VITE_APP_THEME_COLOR="#1F2933"
VITE_APP_BG_COLOR="#EDE8DB"
